    title: { rendered: "用 Docker Compose 跑一个 MySQL" },
    excerpt: { rendered: "<p>一条 compose 文件，比记一堆 run 参数可靠得多。</p>" },
    content: { rendered: "<p>单机跑数据库，compose 文件比记一堆 <code>docker run</code> 参数可靠。</p>\n<pre><code>services:\n  mysql:\n    image: mysql:8.4\n    container_name: mysql8\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      - \"3306:3306\"\n    environment:\n      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: changeit\n      MYSQL_DATABASE: app\n      TZ: Asia/Shanghai\n    command:\n      --character-set-server=utf8mb4\n      --collation-server=utf8mb4_unicode_ci\n    volumes:\n      - ./data:/var/lib/mysql\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"mysqladmin\", \"ping\", \"-h\", \"127.0.0.1\"]\n      interval: 10s\n      retries: 5</code></pre>\n<p><code>docker compose up -d</code> 起来。</p>\n<h2>三个要点</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据必须挂出来</strong>：<code>./data:/var/lib/mysql</code>，否则 <code>down</code> 一次数据全没。</li><li><strong>字符集写进 command</strong>：临时改配置重启就丢，固化到启动参数才作数。</li><li><strong>密码别写进版本库</strong>：用 <code>.env</code> 加 <code>MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=${DB_PASS}</code>。</li></ul>\n<h2>连不上按这个顺序查</h2>\n<pre><code>docker compose ps\ndocker compose logs mysql --tail 50\ndocker exec -it mysql8 mysql -uroot -p</code></pre>" },
